<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83836" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλήρ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filling up, filling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληρώσεσι καὶ κενώσεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					42c
				</span></i>
			; esp. with people, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρώσεις δικαστηρίων καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					956e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς νεώς</span>
			<i>manning</i> the ship, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2501
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sensual satisfaction, gratification,</i> esp. of eating and
			drinking, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πίνειν π. τῆς ἐνδείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					496e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπορίζεσθαι ταῖς ἡδοναῖς
			π.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				492a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληρώσεών τινων καὶ ἡδονῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					439d
				</span></i>
			: as expl. of the origin of pleasure, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				31e
			</span></i>sq., <i><span class="en">
				35a
			</span></i> sq.; of other passions, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμοῦ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			; of the higher aspirations, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				5.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>completion of a number,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆνας ἑπτὰ τοὺς ἐπιλοίπους . . ἐς τὰ
				ὀκτὼ ἔτεα</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πληρώσιος</span> which remained
				<i>to complete</i> the eight years, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς π. ἐκρηγμάτων
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχρημ-</span> Pap.)
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κδ᾽</span> making a <i>total</i> of
				<i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i> sluices, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				11
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>filling up</i> a document, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>becoming full,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς σελήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					582b2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.40U.
			</span></i>; of women, <i>impregnation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τῶν σιτίων π.</span>
			<i>a being filled with</i> food, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ
				ἔνδειαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phgn.</u>
				810b22
			</span></i>: abs., <i>repletion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1380b4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
